---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = "STRUKT | Who builds Vancouver's club nights and festivals";
const description = "STRUKT takes festivals and club nights apart to credit the lighting designers, riggers, artists and crews behind the dance floor. Starting in Vancouver.";
const site = Astro.site ?? new URL('https://strukt.example');
const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  headline: "The lights don't hang themselves",
  description,
  datePublished: "2026-10-28",
  inLanguage: "en-CA",
  image: ["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555086156-e6c7353d283f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=630&q=70"],
  author: { "@type": "Organization", name: "STRUKT", url: site.href },
  publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "STRUKT", logo: { "@type": "ImageObject", url: new URL('/strukt-logo.png', site).href } },
  mainEntityOfPage: new URL('/about/', site).href,
};
---
<Base title={title} description={description} type="article" image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555086156-e6c7353d283f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=630&q=70" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
<main id="page-about" data-progress>
<article aria-labelledby="h-about">

  <section class="open" aria-labelledby="h-about">
    <div class="open-photo photo duo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555086156-e6c7353d283f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=70" alt="Silhouettes of a club crowd in a dark room under hard red light" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div>
    <div class="open-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <svg class="scatter dots" data-align="xMaxYMin" data-scatter='{"seed":11,"w":1600,"h":1000,"clusters":4,"min":40,"max":120,"density":0.55,"strays":30,"x0":0.6,"s0":0.55,"y0":0.45,"keyline":0.5,"pal":[["#8C52FF",6],["#C9B3FF",2],["#1E1530",4]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <svg class="art dots" data-text="00" data-o='{"drop":0.14,"stray":40,"seed":4,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true,"sub":3}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="folio mono"><span>The opening piece</span><span>4 minute read</span><span>p. 01</span></div>
      <h1 id="h-about"><span>The lights</span> <span>don't hang</span> <span>themselves.</span></h1>
      <div class="foot mono">
        <p>Words by STRUKT<br><span class="credit">Photo: Aleksandr Popov, Unsplash</span></p>
        <p>STRUKT takes festivals and club nights apart, piece by piece, so everyone who built them gets credited. It starts in Vancouver, because that's home. It's for everyone, everywhere.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stand">
    <svg class="scatter dots" data-scatter='{"seed":23,"w":600,"h":420,"clusters":3,"min":40,"max":110,"density":0.6,"strays":18,"x0":0.35,"keyline":0.6,"pal":[["#8C52FF",5],["#000000",3],["#FFFFFF",1]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <p>Think about the last show that stopped you mid-sentence. You probably know who was playing. You probably don't know who made that moment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature" aria-label="Opening">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <p class="intro">The room went dark, one beam cut through the haze, and the drop landed exactly when the lights did. <span>Somebody climbed the truss at nine in the morning to hang that light. Somebody programmed that cue at two the night before, then programmed it again.</span></p>
      <div class="body2">
        <p>Somebody built the booth, painted the backdrop, designed the flyer that made you buy the ticket, and pulled cables out of the rain at four, long after you went home. Their names were never on the poster.</p>
        <p class="kicker">STRUKT exists to put them there.</p>
      </div>
      <section class="clock" aria-labelledby="clock-t">
        <p class="mono" id="clock-t">One night, by the clock</p>
        <ol>
          <li><b>02:00</b><span>The cue is programmed. Then programmed again.</span></li>
          <li><b>09:00</b><span>The truss goes up. The first light is hung.</span></li>
          <li><b>18:00</b><span>The booth is built, the backdrop painted.</span></li>
          <li><b>23:00</b><span>Doors. The drop lands with the lights.</span></li>
          <li><b>04:00</b><span>Cables come out of the rain.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>

  <figure class="break photo reveal duo">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1635373308995-52a45b7ff7c6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=70" alt="Stage lighting fixtures clamped to a pole before being rigged for a show" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')">
    <figcaption><span class="time">09:00</span><span class="line">The first light goes up, fourteen hours before anyone sees it.</span><span class="credit mono">Photo: Xavi Cabrera, Unsplash</span></figcaption>
  </figure>

  <section class="why" aria-labelledby="h-why">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <h2 id="h-why"><svg data-glyph="7" aria-hidden="true"></svg>Why here</h2>
      <div class="why-body">
        <p class="opener">Vancouver loves a big night. When the right name comes through, tickets go in minutes and the whole city shows up. Then the tour leaves, and the feeling leaves with it.</p>
        <div class="cols">
          <p>Across Vancouver, the Fraser Valley and the rest of BC, the people who could build something every weekend are already here. The kid learning a lighting console on a borrowed laptop. The painter with nowhere to show. The designer, the rigger, the one who knows how to make an empty room feel like somewhere.</p>
          <p>They're scattered, working alone, waiting for a reason to find each other. We want to give them a place to be seen, so they can find each other, and so the next great night is built here, by people from here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="anat" aria-labelledby="h-name">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid anat-head">
        <h2 id="h-name"><svg data-glyph="44" aria-hidden="true"></svg>Why STRUKT</h2>
        <div class="anat-lede">
          <p>STRUKT comes from structure. Every festival and every club night is built from parts: the sound, the light, the stage, the site, the door, the bar, the people keeping everyone safe.</p>
          <p>We take the night apart, piece by piece, the way you'd take apart a machine to see how it works. Then we credit every person behind every piece.</p>
          <button type="button" class="apart" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="parts">Put the night back together</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="parts" id="parts" aria-label="The parts of a night and who builds them">
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/sound_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The sound</h3><p>Sound engineers tune the room until every low end hits right.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/light_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The light</h3><p>Lighting designers program every cue you feel before you see it.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/stage_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The stage</h3><p>Stage managers call every changeover and keep the night on time.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/site_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The site</h3><p>Riggers and site crews build it out of an empty warehouse or field.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/door_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The door</h3><p>Door staff decide how the night feels from the first second.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/bar_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The bar</h3><p>Bar staff keep a full room going until close.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/safety_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The safety</h3><p>Medics and safety crews make sure everyone gets home.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/artist_dj.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The booth</h3><p>The DJ. The one name that's already on the poster.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/lore_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The story</h3><p>Photographers, writers and designers make sure the night is remembered.</p></li>
          <li class="part"><img class="who" src="/icons/boss_guy.png" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The boss</h3><p>Promoters and producers who bet on the night before a single ticket sold.</p></li>
          <li class="part floor"><img class="crowd" src="/icons/crowd.png" alt="" width="900" height="330" loading="eager" decoding="async"><h3>The floor</h3><p>You. The crowd finishes it.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quote" aria-label="Pull quote">
    <div class="quote-photo photo dk"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630395822310-15b171c9a85f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=70" alt="Silhouettes of a crowd with hands raised at a night out" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div>
    <div class="quote-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <svg class="scatter b dots" data-scatter='{"seed":17,"w":440,"h":360,"clusters":2,"min":40,"max":100,"density":0.6,"strays":20,"keyline":0.4,"pal":[["#C9B3FF",3],["#8C52FF",3],["#FFFFFF",1]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <blockquote>A scene isn't a lineup. It's the people who keep showing up between lineups.</blockquote>
      <cite class="mono">STRUKT, Issue 00<span class="credit"> &nbsp; Photo: Kajetan Sumila, Unsplash</span></cite>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wall" aria-labelledby="h-who">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="h-who">Who it's for: everyone behind the structure</h2>
      <ul class="roles">
        <li>Lighting designers</li><li>Riggers</li><li>Sound engineers</li><li>Stage managers</li><li>VJs</li><li>Visual artists</li><li>Set builders</li><li>Photographers</li><li>Fashion designers</li><li>Pop-up makers</li><li>Flyer designers</li><li>Promoters</li><li>Door staff</li><li>The one who drove the van</li><li>DJs</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="grid split">
        <figure class="dj photo reveal duo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530352865347-3c2e277abefe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="A DJ working the mixer in a dark club booth" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"><figcaption class="credit mono">Photo: Emiliano Vittoriosi, Unsplash</figcaption></figure>
        <div class="split-text">
          <h3>DJs too.</h3>
          <p>But we'll ask them about the crew, the timings and the six a.m. load-outs, not just the music.</p>
          <p>If you've ever made a night happen and gone uncredited, this is for you. If you're just starting and nobody has seen your work yet, this is especially for you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reach" aria-labelledby="h-how">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div class="copy" style="grid-column:2/7">
        <h2 id="h-how" style="margin-top:0"><svg data-glyph="3" aria-hidden="true"></svg>How it works</h2>
        <p>Every week, we sit down with someone who builds the night. Some come from Vancouver's underground. Some have lit stages on the other side of the world. We put them side by side on purpose, because that's where they belong.</p>
        <p>Every night we cover gets a credits card. Everyone who worked it gets named and tagged. No exceptions, and never just "and crew."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="copy" style="grid-column:7/12">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0"><svg data-glyph="12" aria-hidden="true"></svg>Going everywhere</h2>
        <p>STRUKT starts in Vancouver because that's where we are. It doesn't stop there. A rigger in Lagos, a lighting designer in Berlin and a set painter in Abbotsford do the same job, work the same hours and go just as unseen.</p>
        <p>We want them in one place, learning from each other.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="map">
      <svg id="map" role="img" aria-label="Dots connecting Vancouver and Abbotsford to Berlin and Lagos"></svg>
      <figcaption class="mono note">Starting here, going everywhere</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="strip" aria-labelledby="h-floor">
    <div class="wrap strip-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="h-floor">From the floor</h2>
        <p class="mono">Stand-in photos from Unsplash until our own shoots begin. Every photographer is credited.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-btns">
        <button type="button" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Previous photo">Prev</button>
        <button type="button" data-dir="1" aria-label="Next photo">Next</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reel" id="reel" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Photo strip, scroll sideways">
      <figure><div class="photo duo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530014671970-707f86eb10f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" alt="Hands on a turntable at night" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div><figcaption><b>Before doors</b><span class="mono">Photo: Jernej Graj, Unsplash</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure><div class="photo dk"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545128485-c400e7702796?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" alt="A packed room mid-set" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div><figcaption><b>The room</b><span class="mono">Photo: Pim Myten, Unsplash</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure><div class="photo duo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594623930572-300a3011d9ae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" alt="A mixer lit blue in the dark" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div><figcaption><b>The booth</b><span class="mono">Photo: Aleksandr Popov, Unsplash</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure><div class="photo lil"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522745287160-f12721561e60?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" alt="Hands raised in black and white" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div><figcaption><b>The drop</b><span class="mono">Photo: Tyler Quick, Unsplash</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure><div class="photo dk"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511016469271-ba8f47d3a2e1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" alt="A crowd inside a dim room" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div><figcaption><b>Last song</b><span class="mono">Photo: Aleksandr Popov, Unsplash</span></figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="close">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <p class="big">Our logo is made of hundreds of small dots. You'd never notice any single one. Take them away, and there's nothing left to read. That's the scene. That's you.</p>
      <p class="sign">Welcome to STRUKT. Let's build something.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</article>

  <section class="cta">
    <svg class="scatter dots" data-scatter='{"seed":61,"w":520,"h":360,"clusters":3,"min":40,"max":100,"density":0.6,"strays":16,"x0":0.3,"keyline":0.6,"pal":[["#8C52FF",4],["#000000",3],["#FFFFFF",1]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>Built something?</p>
      <a href="/call-for-creatives/">Submit your work to STRUKT</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="credits" aria-label="Credits">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <svg class="t dots" data-text="CREDITS" data-o='{"drop":0.05,"stray":14,"seed":2,"color":"#000000","keyline":true}' role="img" aria-label="Credits"></svg>
      <dl>
        <dt>Words</dt><dd>STRUKT</dd>
        <dt>Design</dt><dd>STRUKT</dd>
        <dt>Photos</dt><dd>Unsplash contributors, named in captions</dd>
        <dt>Published by</dt><dd>Obslik Studios</dd>
        <dt>Next feature</dt><dd><a href="/call-for-creatives/" aria-label="Next feature: you. Submit your work">You?</a></dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
